From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moonlight-XR-Native <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 06:59:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Game Mode: scale the flat UI up (QT_SCALE_FACTOR, 1.5 by
 default, MLXR_LAUNCHER_SCALE)

Moonlight XR Native (lane launcher2). The desktop stays stock.
---
 app/main.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/app/main.cpp b/app/main.cpp
index 346615f..6e7faa2 100644
--- a/app/main.cpp
+++ b/app/main.cpp
@@ -578,6 +578,10 @@ int main(int argc, char *argv[])
     SDL_SetHint(SDL_HINT_WINDOWS_DISABLE_THREAD_NAMING, "0");
 #endif
 
+    // Moonlight XR Native (lane launcher2): a larger UI in Game Mode (QT_SCALE_FACTOR, read
+    // when the QGuiApplication is created); the desktop stays stock
+    MlxrHandoff::applyGameModeScale();
+
     QGuiApplication app(argc, argv);
 
 #ifndef STEAM_LINK
